<section class="page-hero wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Questions & answers</p><h1>A little clarity<br>before the clean.</h1><p class="lede">The practical questions first. If your situation needs more detail, tell us before requesting a date.</p></section><section class="wrap section faq-list"><details><summary>How much does house cleaning cost in Calgary?</summary><p>Your quote depends on the size, condition, bathrooms, frequency and specific work. We provide a written quote before confirmation.</p></details><details><summary>How is move-out cleaning different?</summary><p>An empty property may need appliance interiors, inside storage, trim and other detail beyond maintenance cleaning. Include your handover deadline and requested checklist.</p></details><details><summary>Is my appointment booked when I send the form?</summary><p>No. You are requesting a quote and preferred timing. The appointment is confirmed separately after scope, price and cleaner availability are agreed.</p></details><details><summary>Can I request weekly or bi-weekly visits?</summary><p>Yes. Share preferred days and frequency. A recurring schedule depends on available cleaner coverage and the scope you accept.</p></details><details><summary>Will I get the same cleaner?</summary><p>Continuity is a preference we can discuss. Please ask about continuity when requesting a recurring schedule; a particular cleaner cannot be assumed.</p></details><details><summary>Do you bring supplies?</summary><p>Supplies, equipment and any product preferences must be agreed with the scope before confirmation. Tell us about sensitive surfaces and allergies.</p></details><details><summary>What areas do you serve?</summary><p>The launch focus is Calgary. Share your neighbourhood or postal code so we can check coverage. Surrounding-city availability is not assumed.</p></details><details><summary>What happens if I need to cancel?</summary><p>Contact us promptly. The applicable cancellation and rescheduling terms need to be provided before you accept a quote. Keep the terms with your booking confirmation.</p></details><details><summary>Can I share photos with my landlord?</summary><p>Discuss the completion record and intended recipients before the job. A cleaning record does not guarantee a deposit return.</p></details><details><summary>How do I apply as an experienced cleaner?</summary><p>Use the Work with us page to prepare an introduction. Please do not send ID, banking information or client access codes with an initial application.</p></details></section><section class="closing wrap"><div><p class="eyebrow">Your next step</p><h2>A clear plan for your next clean.</h2><p>Tell us about your space. We’ll review the scope, timing and cleaner availability before confirming your appointment.</p></div><a class="button light" href="/book/">Book your clean</a></section>
